<title>UK: BT to start EU talks on MCI merger next week.</title>
<headline>BT to start EU talks on MCI merger next week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc said on Tuesday that routine discussions with European Union regulators about its proposed $20 bln merger with MCI Communications Corp were likely to begin next week.</p>
<p>BT said it remained unclear what, if any, conditions could be imposed on the merger. A company spokesman said BT had not been given any indication that the EU had any problem with its merger plans.</p>
<p>Newspaper reports have speculated that minor conditions may be placed on the new company, to be called Concert Plc.</p>
</text>
